tIsMyPublicServerIp { ip }\n\nNew holder type WhatIsMyPublicServerIpQuery carries getPublicIp as an instance\n@GraphQLField method (@GraphQLName \"ip\"); the *Extension class keeps a single\nwhatIsMyPublicServerIp accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"publicServerIpAdmin\")\nstays on the leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixture/specs updated in lockstep.\n(Query-only module — no mutation.)\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"1892de10c1e145343cb60d2d104da90e84d6c0e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/trees/1892de10c1e145343cb60d2d104da90e84d6c0e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/commits/e9792e0a79283410934381f156aeb295f67e21db","verification":{"payload":"tree 1892de10c1e145343cb60d2d104da90e84d6c0e8\nparent 3296e19eea94238920c71dfa87b99487bcfb4c2f\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782026998 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782026998 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest the public-IP query under a whatIsMyPublicServerIp namespace container (#23)\n\nThe single query was a flat root scalar field. Nest it under a same-named namespace\ncontainer with an inner field, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query: whatIsMyPublicServerIp (String) -> whatIsMyPublicServerIp { ip }\n\nNew holder type WhatIsMyPublicServerIpQuery carries getPublicIp as an instance\n@GraphQLField method (@GraphQLName \"ip\"); the *Extension class keeps a single\nwhatIsMyPublicServerIp accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"publicServerIpAdmin\")\nstays on the leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixture/specs updated in lockstep.\n(Query-only module — no mutation.)\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5L2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAE+YQAAJwa6VHWRqu9kzDfqHlPqZz\nTt6OVfU81kdCqEGhtoF07ZIyDTBOThlcyLJBsryCmLeAvfxEnwDg82oq9uWUKQKK\ny2b01cKOdqw5kCOWtbNT+ytC7DCNifo