d CsvSource import in PublicIpValidationTest (Sonar S1128).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"5df31b67c53374b8a945d304f73aa6d3c2ac03b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/trees/5df31b67c53374b8a945d304f73aa6d3c2ac03b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/commits/3296e19eea94238920c71dfa87b99487bcfb4c2f","verification":{"payload":"tree 5df31b67c53374b8a945d304f73aa6d3c2ac03b6\nparent 42e83c3d6fa16cda46feaf9af869bca3b2f7dd62\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781976681 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781976681 +0200\n\nrefactor: move static cache writes into a static helper; drop unused import (#18)\n\n- PublicIp.get() (an instance method) wrote the static cache fields directly,\n  which Sonar S2696 flags as masking shared mutable state. Extract a private\n  static storeInCache(ip, timestamp) so the static mutation is explicit. No\n  API/behavior change (get() stays an instance method).\n- Remove the unused CsvSource import in PublicIpValidationTest (Sonar S1128).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNs5pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsq4QACN5D/gEGfXBj8YaOIxQsNv7\nNLgdOV9ywlIm+sUFEjNceo46l+/dqv+0cztXf1ikM7iXcBHQ99wrRETXiPAnsAZi\n7ROGza7oYKjm0G201DFhi4QRBikFsNKSEzVZJ+xq+NA4/pDJSIFUwS/jiYKMKb0a\na2COZew70/AofrVyesPZZ5imxwmqYPyOlrhhj3w1XL9HDnLCLwAlGRvRseZhD2LC\nfIECH6B20Qs0F4KceX+u2YI3pu855Z4Ww3dZeCvARIQATEr6X94/r64m524Il8yo\nh2hkRL7Y7sEHJnPqHX/URbN6byFvtXLoOqsTYrt3QBPK9ceA4K4VLpGoNau24GzL\n7HSZCykmVYM0RDznokWF7bvzfsgGa+tbcLKw6pTRvK0SixG3dvSughfXM6HP95mg\nhHeWc+BK/F+qXyFgEW+JqBUDLbMiGekbsEH6WGxi/gbceD6NQaCt4XXUGLmpYrUY\n3TS0KO3kzO+wT+gFCDPqfpNksWRYMtZMzQbP+vdZwBJ/QUwcxoDKLG0FBNkQlg2q\ns20mCIY4Tc5jJnndINhlPozzy62y6cEi+8rX4SLlpcPBswQ2pwwYDB7TF8QtAz+i\nvGfWq+2ZIE818aBtx5qN+maTQGaVn17L8Ww+JdM0LlJl3YUw/isFx57XftJhEgZj\nT2j4mNdMW7X6zAz2BP6F\n=Lcq+\n---