ttps://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commits/42e83c3d6fa16cda46feaf9af869bca3b2f7dd62"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commits/9627cd902de71b02eec32fb45228c975b3819eba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:41Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#17)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the publicServerIpAdmin fine-grained permission and\nship an assignable server-level role so the permission can be granted without\nfull server administrator rights.\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: new ''what-is-my-public-server-ip-administrator''\n  role (rep:root, server-role, privilegedAccess) granting only\n  ''administrationAccess publicServerIpAdmin''.\n- tests/cypress/e2e/02-whatIsMyPublicServerIp-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests\n  proving the gate end-to-end with a user granted ONLY the module role\n  (never admin):\n    * GraphQL whatIsMyPublicServerIp denied without the permission\n      (Permission denied), allowed with it (returns a valid IP).\n    * Admin panel hidden without the permission, shown with it\n      (reusing the existing [class*=\"ipValue\"] panel assertion).\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.0.4-SNAPSHOT -> 2.0.5-SNAPSHOT so the\n  new import content (roles.xml) is re-imported on deploy.\n\nNo resolver change needed: the query is gated solely by the\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"publicServerIpAdmin\") annotation with no inner\nhardcoded admin check.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f9368ee83261c970bd5a4adc66930c3456f82a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/trees/7f9368ee83261c970bd5a4adc66930c3456f82a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/commits/9627cd902de71b02eec32fb45228c975b3819eba","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f9368ee83261c970bd5a4adc66930c3456f82a8\nparent bee3e4d29cb10394ee6efa57c9be3b03de1ce134\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781118401 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781118401 +0200\n\ntest: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#17)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the publicServerIpAdmin fine-grained permission and\nship an assignable server-level role so the permission can be granted without\nfull server administrator rights.\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: new ''what-is-my-public-server-ip-administrator''\n  role (rep:root, server-role, privilegedAccess) granting only\n  ''administrationAccess publicServerIpAdmin''.\n- tests/cypress/e2e/02-whatIsMyPublicServerIp-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests\n  proving the gate end-to-end with a user granted ONLY the module role\n  (never admin):\n    * GraphQL whatIsMyPublicServerIp denied without the permission\n      (Permission denied), allowed with it (returns a valid IP).\n    * Admin panel hidden without the permission, shown with it\n      (reusing the existing [class*=\"ipValue\"] panel assertion).\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.0.4-SNAPSHOT -> 2.0.5-SNAPSHOT so the\n  new import content (roles.xml) is re-imported on deploy.\n\nNo resolver change needed: the query is gated solely by the\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"publicServerIpAdmin\") annotation with no inner\nhardcoded admin check.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKbXBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA34cQAGeqUBKsEPdBqjg5FOn//zKN\nlIVWkF4e3XJtCKE9KayUF6EPDDu88gnpx2+4pIqUtAIrKCD17D4RetJRoc4nDZSt\nvQgBBw/NBTMgvPiw3g30pUdhJv/GvU2/zI3jY1mDJoAYBxizK7erTNmGM3jYQVn6\nirppK/FEv1pOxanZIm7J1EUmaDdFuNgOBEQSbwKJvQC1yx3p5E81symuV+jLpx7M\n64WOWVVCO8ZKfcIoVQKGiaay2TVXuulaRjLEsi543iMbY0sYGhHnfOdyUSrpNoYA\n9/reX5892xRnCbSOi111Haxfg3cHvulfTWnBE1zQW+ihnMlLhpXc0BQlFTV+ZdTG\nlf+70PMFaB0hWZBGwENbehVXD/rn5Wa2MUIYMrbM72U9/EgOlVD2dBKvx02wDM6y\nsfchn7irYndw5kW4ZH9GafillnUyA1O1N+Il1qJxLJmEOe8a9mqFgHBe1XKciH9j\n88RPOp7YIaITrx+0H+SfMVfUPymi7kjmHPA7TyVKfaHYUDPHyAgaEyillMkbIhnK\nbgny9qshpVXjM6Vsh6/ONBJUIgBl0ye7+EqUsqIurjonXhPFSGgdYtVhIfvdJAMO\nmdga3YMYYbus7i+glBVZauEhsvyHSeXNmN6+qBbm4M4UzHWgxwOUv0kGqdTe6ggc\nHLyrXpU95BXl+H1kit4j\n=occQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T19:06:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commit/9627cd902de71b02eec32fb45228c975b3819eba","node_id":"C_kwDODIEvl9oAKDk2MjdjZDkwMmRlNzFiMDJlZWMzMmZiNDUyMjhjOTc1YjM4MTllYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commit/bee3e4d29cb10394ee6efa57c9be3b03de1ce134","sha":"bee3e4d29cb10394ee6efa57c9be3b03de1ce134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commits/bee3e4d29cb10394ee6efa57c9be3b03de1ce134"}],"sha":"9627cd902de71b02eec32fb45228c975b3819eba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commits/9627cd902de71b02eec32fb45228c975b3819eba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commits/bee3e4d29cb10394ee6efa57c9be3b03de1ce134/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:41:21Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:41:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add publicServerIpAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#16)\n\n* feat: add publicServerIpAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nDefine a module-specific `publicServerIpAdmin` JCR permission as a child\nof the `admin` permission node in permissions.xml so that access to the\nwhatIsMyPublicServerIp GraphQL query can be granted without requiring\nfull platform admin rights.  Full admins continue to work via JCR\nprivilege inheritance.\n\nReplace the generic `@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"admin\")` annotation on\n`WhatIsMyPublicServerIpQueryExtension.getPublicIp()` with the new\n`publicServerIpAdmin` permission name.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5455bb9575fa8fc8ba9220af25642e6bc9c7dec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/trees/a5455bb9575fa8fc8ba9220af25642e6bc9c7dec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/commits/bee3e4d29cb10394ee6efa57c9be3b03de1ce134","verification":{"payload":"tree a5455bb9575fa8fc8ba9220af25642e6bc9c7dec\nparent 2c171886401cb8e6993545ca71d21c3311addd64\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781084481 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781084481 +0200\n\nfeat: add publicServerIpAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#16)\n\n* feat: add publicServerIpAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nDefine a module-specific `publicServerIpAdmin` JCR permission as a child\nof the `admin` permission node in permissions.xml so that access to the\nwhatIsMyPublicServerIp GraphQL query can be granted without requiring\nfull platform admin rights.  Full admins continue to work via JCR\nprivilege inheritance.\n\nReplace the generic `@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"admin\")` annotation on\n`WhatIsMyPublicServerIpQueryExtension.getPublicIp()` with the new\n`publicServerIpAdmin` permission name.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKTFBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAjkQAErQY8L3f7p7hr5TKe57N4Qb\n1dEVyP+B8SHCYtzd4o4HBLbwvaE2UHoLgcrCuoUKJfGe9mzACNrzXdVV0zZxma+S\n5nyHAt3KYzj29FV7qJDM/VxA39tBcRIRxWxTBfXCaY3zkX2oWyqxgwwZIRjWd4BC\nHYUB9hSMUKLsT19nxsmamHC6VdJxmKW81kiv1ZenrTMY25cLSH3/aPTy9GD2aRVy\nR0ZSGyXmpm3bosdxtvhwkU13Gl06daNJ8R8xWGOw9oKiC9wcicB8IRYkF6Nk2/5R\nro7d/7QudvgDFueP/K//4sLSpMZ3Ln3Ey1izR6+Y8MIWcIINGANqL/nMUoi9JphZ\neZVqFFNAViLL/8kaVOPqlMJivtcYP0kNSNUMxsXI5m1P/w+w4R9HidaWvn7mXWIO\nDY/ncFWmLIlq7+fi8rJx240+ZhVDNnwl0K2JRIcVFcsf6L1Uu5/P6k9JV1deH42q\nz8sVlnM31DaQ6MJ91T3Vybv4pW8Nt/A8XLc6/z27XD0tMbHQXP0Xx3w5vAUB5zC4\nUsf6r0sUXa3zRRT9T8RJjpRdsF7/klciA2YTPaSZ54PDq4DJQtnINlARl9I7/bdg\ng3mlgpWd7R7k0nORppt+T9H6JOYEUMrkECncXSybpOKNHiFwUNBFoSuORehPkfhW\n3hiIN0/LvHlsaTI+uJeG\n=amG+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T09:41:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://g