a.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:58Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test: add JUnit 5 unit tests for PublicIp IP-literal validation logic\n\nCovers isValidIpLiteral() via reflection with 29 parameterized cases:\n- valid IPv4 (including boundary values like 0.0.0.0 and 255.255.255.255)\n- valid IPv6 (full form, compressed ::1, link-local fe80::1)\n- injection attempts (shell injection, XSS, CRLF, path traversal, SQL)\n- empty, null, and oversized inputs\n- malformed addresses (non-hex chars, wrong segment counts, 999.x.x.x)\n\nAdds junit-jupiter 5.10.3 (test scope) and pins maven-surefire-plugin\nto ${surefire.plugin.version} inherited from the parent POM to suppress\nthe missing-version warning.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d163525ec477b3aec976bd4a1fc1d0be4ca061b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/trees/1d163525ec477b3aec976bd4a1fc1d0be4ca061b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/commits/e92e65c3b4b3bc5a7cb236d3485e01fdb9e481c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d163525ec477b3aec976bd4a1fc1d0be4ca061b\nparent f08699de8b4d96803376171bbf6111bcd5dfb95f\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750138 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750138 +0200\n\ntest: add JUnit 5 unit tests for PublicIp IP-literal validation logic\n\nCovers isValidIpLiteral() via reflection with 29 parameterized cases:\n- valid IPv4 (including boundary values like 0.0.0.0 and 255.255.255.255)\n- valid IPv6 (full form, compressed ::1, link-local fe80::1)\n- injection attempts (shell injection, XSS, CRLF, path traversal, SQL)\n- empty, null, and oversized inputs\n- malformed addresses (non-hex chars, wrong segment counts, 999.x.x.x)\n\nAdds junit-jupiter 5.10.3 (test scope) and pins maven-surefire-plugin\nto ${surefire.plugin.version} inherited from the parent POM to suppress\nthe missing-version warning.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFzoACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kn6wf/WyiftRDLOHNiRQmG8i9CD6nn0Q50BHd5FRjG7QOlEa34kt6/fDP+/CP7\nhlhT7Onf5bdjzjgxIOGQunpIjC8jE5arvUOywt0MHmALPRBBqjg5qtN8pGTJhCux\n/r/F0Dx6clLY6IAjUx9CFriU9D24tlOLDr2eNvD91uWrCeAZfaDlF5QeD3Pm5xCl\nKsaJyFKiwwqlnsAazUnAGo7v2uumBRddGGdoxcYGqwCVyh/LlYp0j3N66JZoStEK\nPYE7bQYP5ofLS83W9u89FWkYoUCxEsHNenZO3k+BFFW/L04ob8OfcCxMvorpVXGC\nwzap4l1F+tF7KH8rmqd22z6PUKBeXw==\n=BHbB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:38:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commit/e92e65c3b4b3bc5a7cb236d3485e01fdb9e481c4","node_id":"C_kwDODIEvl9oAKGU5MmU2NWMzYjRiM2JjNWE3Y2IyMzZkMzQ4NWUwMWZkYjllNDgxYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commit/f08699de8b4d96803376171bbf6111bcd5dfb95f","sha":"f08699de8b4d96803376171bbf6111bcd5dfb95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commits/f08699de8b4d96803376171bbf6111bcd5dfb95f"}],"sha":"e92e65c3b4b3bc5a7cb236d3485e01fdb9e481c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commits/e92e65c3b4b3bc5a7cb236d3485e01fdb9e481c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/commits/f08699de8b4d96803376171bbf6111bcd5dfb95f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:50Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:48:50Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"perf: add 60s TTL cache to PublicIp to avoid per-call HTTP round-trips\n\nEvery GraphQL invocation previously made a fresh synchronous outbound\nHTTP call to checkip.amazonaws.com (up to 10s total timeout), causing\nlatency spikes on repeated admin refreshes and risking rate-limiting\non the external service.\n\nA lightweight volatile-field cache (60s TTL) is added directly in\nPublicIp. The cache is class-level (static volatile fields) so it is\nshared across all instances within the same OSGi bundle classloader.\nThread safety is achieved without locking: the double-read pattern on\nvolatile fields is sufficient for a best-effort cache where a brief\nthundering-herd on expiry is acceptable.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"30b2ebce81e6354b28d667bbe7577adf32a5e7cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/trees/30b2ebce81e6354b28d667bbe7577adf32a5e7cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/commits/f08699de8b4d96803376171bbf6111bcd5dfb95f","verification":{"payload":"tree 30b2ebce81e6354b28d667bbe7577adf32a5e7cc\nparent 4974417768669060d1dd97eac24b7a0adaf0786a\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750130 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750130 +0200\n\nperf: add 60s TTL cache to PublicIp to avoid per-call HTTP round-trips\n\nEvery GraphQL invocation previously made a fresh synchronous outbound\nHTTP call to checkip.amazonaws.com (up to 10s total timeout), causing\nlatency spikes on repeated admin refreshes and risking rate-limiting\non the external service.\n\nA lightweight volatile-field cache (60s TTL) is added directly in\nPublicIp. The cache is class-level (static volatile fields) so it is\nshared across all instances within the same OSGi bundle classloader.\nThread safety is achieved without locking: the double-read pattern on\nvolatile fields is sufficient for a best-effort cache where a brief\nthundering-herd on expiry is acceptable.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFzIACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mStwf/bJ+dgqQ3eMHswbO7ISayofOdnnBkqbBHXzpn54roXzvYn+kGvIHMAUVa\nUWbF/0cFWvIoQIRpAs4hVqb8tadJSeQ1Nf37zvBzb77/wpvRJ3HfaE+u0ZY6CbFf\nJwTp/1J