@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b8969781d45d8e64c2d2751dd62d0c8e6f24ae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/trees/3b8969781d45d8e64c2d2751dd62d0c8e6f24ae0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/what-is-my-public-server-ip/git/commits/65aacadb4f3dec8049d2e1915a53d9a7d607e54e","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b8969781d45d8e64c2d2751dd62d0c8e6f24ae0\nparent 8d0be3ea6fed0746025cadc8a1365044220cb934\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778939542 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778939542 +0200\n\nHarden public IP fetch: HTTPS, timeouts, bounded read, IP validation\n\n- Switch upstream URL to https://checkip.amazonaws.com\n- Add connect/read timeouts and disable redirect following\n- Cap response read to 64 chars to prevent unbounded body consumption\n- Validate the returned token as an IP literal (charset + InetAddress)\n  before returning it, to avoid propagating unexpected payloads / log\n  injection vectors to callers\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIdpYACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nO3Qf+NBtM9KJ0l29JgpbIbAR6YSuVatigmgwHcQMJ4ygQ1ee0IPZ4e9wvl6KZ\nabEhJUWgrX8gVobdXAj/WCOTvGuISdf0jjdRpQS/lH8Uex22y1b78lsUUxG7Nb0r\nUVIGGHumuBFlIMlYuskMv4RXnYN+A4E7KZVuQQw27qv8LsifjH9PhxILzROHiss/\niYbdat8RTvcKq3F35/Cpmb/wPClQsJ3svoV19MvS0yOZdEeyo9JCbrD6PTyO2YSm\n8SnptUfHvjaGxtchzEqF93B1RiAf+j5kPVsvuQLMDwfajBHTWxbLP1XNR+eluDml\nlAD2y96dGZG3/mu8V1fVwrh1d1PqKQ==\n=ufge\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T11:19:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse